animation_notes: |
  ## Cinematic Simulation Prompt — 04: Governance & TDD Enforcement

  **SCENE 1 — "The Awakening" (0:00–0:06)**
  Camera: Static center-frame. Environment: Absolute dark-blue vacuum (#0a0e27).
  A high-resolution CORTEX logo (cortex-docs/assets/images/cortex-logo-512.png) fades in,
  centered on a ray-traced glassmorphism floor. An 'electric-aura' animation ignites —
  concentric cyan (#00d4ff) and purple (#7b61ff) pulse-glows radiate outward, reflecting
  off the polished glass surface. Volumetric blue fog at floor level. Hold 4s.
  Logo shrinks to bottom-right watermark (15% opacity).

  **SCENE 2 — "FPV Drone Dive: The Shield Wall" (0:06–0:20)**
  Camera: FPV drone dives from the logo through volumetric fog into a fortress of
  three concentric glassmorphism shield walls — each rendered as frosted Deep Cobalt
  (#1a1f3a) with Midnight Blue (#0a0e27) edges and internal neon filaments:
  - Inner Shield (Pre-Commit): red (#ff4444) neon filaments — the hardest gate.
    "Lidar Blue" laser sweep scans the shield surface.
  - Middle Shield (CI Pipeline): amber (#ffa500) neon filaments — warning tier.
  - Outer Shield (Runtime Validation): green (#00ff88) neon filaments — continuous guard.
  Each shield layer activates sequentially with a radial pulse. A bioluminescent
  code particle (cyan orb with neon light-trail) approaches the Inner Shield.
  First attempt: particle strikes the Pre-Commit shield — RED flash, particle bounces
  back with a shockwave ripple across the glass surface (violation detected).
  The particle reforms, carries a fix patch (green glow overlay), re-approaches —
  passes through with a green shimmer. Each subsequent shield opens with a magnetic
  iris animation as the particle passes. Ray-traced reflections on all glass surfaces.

  **SCENE 3 — "TDD Heartbeat: The ECG of Quality" (0:20–0:34)**
  Camera: Pulls back to reveal a glassmorphism medical monitor below the Shield Wall.
  An ECG heartbeat line renders in real-time across the screen:
  - RED peak (#ff4444): frosted glass test capsule materializes — "Write Failing Test"
    — neon red filaments pulse.
  - GREEN peak (#00ff88): code capsule materializes — "Implement Minimum" — neon green
    filaments pulse. The test capsule flashes green (passing).
  - BLUE peak (#3b82f6): refactor capsule materializes — "Clean Up" — neon blue
    filaments pulse. Code capsule restructures with a smooth morph animation.
  The ECG rhythm loops continuously (3 cycles visible). The heartbeat trail is
  bioluminescent, leaving persistent neon traces. Each peak casts volumetric light
  onto the surrounding fog.

  **SCENE 4 — "Unified View: Shield Wall + ECG" (0:34–0:44)**
  Camera: Wide pull-back. Shield Wall (top) and TDD ECG (bottom) merge into a
  unified glassmorphism panel. The Governance Rules Engine appears center-right:
  "38 CORE Rules" rendered as a YAML registry inside a frosted glass slab with
  purple (#7b61ff) neon filaments. EnforcementOrchestrator connects to all three
  shields via purple neon conduits. SQLite Audit Log renders as a glass database
  cylinder with amber glow, receiving log entries from every interaction.
  Business book callouts fade in as glassmorphism info-pills (2-second overlays):
  "Good to Great: First Who, Then What" — "Checklist Manifesto: Simple checks,
  complex outcomes."

  **SCENE 5 — "Orbital Reveal" (0:44–0:54)**
  Camera: 360-degree orbital pan around the combined Shield Wall + TDD ECG architecture.
  All shields glow at full luminosity. The ECG heartbeat continues its rhythm.
  Volumetric fog swirls at the base. Ray-traced reflections cascade across every
  glass surface. Camera completes orbit, pulls back. Architecture fades to 40%.
  Glassmorphism "Evidence Bundle" icon materializes center-frame — sealed document
  with cyan checkmark — fades to black.
